{% comment %}
REVIEW ONLY. Insert once below the acknowledgement in the existing Shopify
order-confirmation notification. Check sample-only, MTM and mixed orders.
This content does not change order, payment, approval or workroom state.
Preserve the notification's existing summary, tax and payment logic.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign curtainsuk_has_mtm = false %}
{% for line in line_items %}
  {% if line.properties['_curtainsuk_mtm_locked'] == 'true' %}
    {% assign curtainsuk_has_mtm = true %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if curtainsuk_has_mtm %}
  <div lang="en" dir="ltr" style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#173d35;background:#f8f6ef;padding:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:22px;">Your made-to-measure curtains</h2>
    <p>Paid made-to-measure orders go to CurtainsUK review. Payment does not automatically approve manufacture or release an order to the workroom.</p>
    <p>Need to request a change? Email us within 2 hours of placing your order at <a href="mailto:enquiries@curtainsuk.com">enquiries@curtainsuk.com</a>. We’ll review your request and get in touch.</p>
    <p>Requested changes are not guaranteed. This request window does not affect your statutory rights.</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.curtainsuk.com/pages/made-to-measure-orders">Your made-to-measure order</a></p>
  </div>
{% endif %}
<div lang="en" dir="ltr" style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">
  <p>Customer support: <a href="mailto:support@curtainsuk.com">support@curtainsuk.com</a><br>
  Complaints: <a href="mailto:complaints@curtainsuk.com">complaints@curtainsuk.com</a></p>
  <p><a href="https://www.curtainsuk.com/policies/refund-policy">Refunds &amp; Returns</a> ·
  <a href="https://www.curtainsuk.com/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> ·
  <a href="https://www.curtainsuk.com/policies/terms-of-service">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></p>
</div>
